  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Finely chop brown onion. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6964835330d8e7c0c766b83b/step-c37f9900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 2-3 mins. Stir in arborio rice, the water, garlic &amp; herb spice <br>blend and the stock powder. Bring to the boil.<br>• Transfer to a baking dish. Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6964835330d8e7c0c766b83b/step-50e47f10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, cut zucchini into half-moons. Trim beans and cut in half. Finely chop or crush garlic.<br>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook zucchini and beans until softened, 4-6 mins. Add garlic and baby spinach. Season and cook, stirring, until wilted, 1 min.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6964835330d8e7c0c766b83b/step-103fd620.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Remove risotto from oven and stir through a splash of water to loosen, if needed.<br>• Stir in Parmesan cheese, basil pesto and green veggies. Season to taste.<br>• Divide risotto between bowls.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6964835330d8e7c0c766b83b/step-08b09c30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
